An Archmechanic is a senior engineer of [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]], one to a city, who supervises that city's transport cluster. In the Org's early days there were no [[Phenomena/Hearts|Hearts]] to coordinate the trains, so a human was wired through magic to sensors all across the city and piloted every train from a single center; that was the first Archmechanic, [[People/Forster Cain|Forster Cain]], Prime Meridian's founder. The role has grown since, and the Archmechanic now coordinates the Hearts that run a city's transport. [[People/Hogan Voss Darkmoor|Hogan Voss Darkmoor]] of the Darkmoors is one.
